  "entry": "code/streamlit_app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Load an FCS file, run a fixed parse→compensate→arcsinh→FlowSOM-style clustering→UMAP pipeline, look over populations through a UMAP, a frequency bar chart, a marker heatmap and a summary table, flag clusters that look like artifacts with a z-score/IsolationForest detector that uses no AI, and export a reproducible report with the file checksum and run settings. An LLM interpretation step is optional. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
